<title>USA: Dupont Photomasks starts Scotland plant.</title>
<headline>Dupont Photomasks starts Scotland plant.</headline>
<dateline>ROUND ROCK, Texas 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>DuPont Photomasks Inc said Tuesday that it has started construction on its photomask plant in Scotland.</p>
<p>The plant is to be built over five years at a cost of more than $31 million, the company said. It is to open in the 1997's second half with 30 employees.</p>
<p>Photomasks are a semiconductor manufacturing component used to make products such as microprocessors and memory chips.</p>
<p>DuPont said it will have nine photomask plants when the Scottish facility is completed.</p>
</text>
